{'symbol': 'T', 'date': '2023-01-04 19:50:00', 'title': 'AT&T CFO UPDATES SHAREHOLDERS AT CITI MEDIA & ENTERTAINMENT CONFERENCE', 'text': 'DALLAS , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PASCAL DESROCHES, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, AT&T * INC. ( NYSE:T ), SPOKE TODAY AT THE CITI MEDIA & ENTERTAINMENT CONFERENCE WHERE HE PROVIDED AN UPDATE TO SHAREHOLDERS. DESROCHES MADE THE FOLLOWING POINTS: THE COMPANY CONTINUES TO FOCUS ITS EFFORTS ON DRIVING SOLID GROWTH IN 5G AND FIBER SERVICES, DRIVEN BY CONTINUED HIGH DEMAND FOR CONNECTIVITY.'}